{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1000_005yay", "source_sha256": "013b909a9c205a972969a0d887de700aa6be26b1c0eb81f48e194c8ab4c3c4c8", "ja": "お疲れさまでした{$P$}！\n今日も一日、ありがとうございました～っ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}！\n今天一整天真的非常感谢你～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1001_p", "source_sha256": "fda4220a38fe4c67e5102d6a63e84a7082bc4910c9b2d56cbe716763eb8e034d", "ja": "ああ、やよいも気を付けて帰……ふぁぁぁ～っ、\nっと、すまん。気を付けて帰るんだぞ？", "zh": "嗯，弥生回家路上也要小……呼啊啊啊～\n啊，抱歉。回家路上也要小心喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "9073f195a0bc123fd07dfbef7bcc49a4424aaaf2ef2841e5b3e97c0478807403", "ja": "……{$P$}？　もしかして、\nお仕事が忙しくて、疲れてるんですか？", "zh": "……{$P$}？\n该不会是因为工作太忙，所以累了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "73373f0510d05070c2d1286e746ba97ecadf01e4e562eabdcfc875ca056053a0", "ja": "無理したらメッ、ですからねっ。\n今日はゆっくり寝てくださいね？", "zh": "太勉强自己是不行的！\n今天要好好睡饱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1004_p", "source_sha256": "396430865a89bebdae6a007c2706b3f3bc7462b57c18fe795fa1f6f441f3351c", "ja": "そうだな。今日は早めに切り上げることにするよ。\nやよいも、今日は家でゆっくり休むんだぞ？", "zh": "说得也对，我今天会早点下班的。\n弥生也是，今天要在家好好休息喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "29272c4015b749e22d80854c0220c846013d85e280a297b706011de90a62e207", "ja": "私は大丈夫ですー。私、この前のリリース公演の時から\n毎日ぐっすり眠れてて、元気モリモリですから！", "zh": "我没问题的～我从之前的发片公演开始\n就每天都睡得很熟，活力旺盛得不得了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1006_005yay", "source_sha256": "621f72ced434ec2e5998c43fee8c8e3d42a04adb341b6d7c2e0f3ff0e9bfa6b9", "ja": "弟達にライブで練習した歌を歌うと、みんなすぐに眠っ\nちゃって、私もいつの間にかくーって寝ちゃうんです。", "zh": "每当我把为了演唱会练习的歌唱给弟妹们听，\n他们很快就会睡着，我也会不知不觉间呼～地睡着喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e3c56cdc2d71376d3c47a0dc77c87fe5beaa16cd2a6a6a7474958ceb82a8e898", "ja": "はは、アイドルのお姉さんの子守歌か。\nそれはもう、効果抜群だろうな。", "zh": "哈哈，偶像姊姊唱的摇篮曲吗。\n效果肯定好到不行吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "4f189a75de040955d62ff49dd5a59a0f8a001606e00a1300b67ac3b09fa078b5", "ja": "あ！　いいこと思いついちゃいましたっ！", "zh": "啊！我想到一个好主意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "82a073a3b8593b20c6f24372fadbdc2ac39e304f2ea2804cd344de857730eb79", "ja": "今度私の子守歌を録音して、{$P$}に\nそのカセットテープをプレゼントしますねっ！", "zh": "下次我把我的摇篮曲录下来，\n再把录音带送给{$P$}吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1010_p", "source_sha256": "fc848a80a535b7f65e6207fdcf9baaf36ef8e68a04588b583c50ba0d71a3c9fc", "ja": "カセットテープ……、を？", "zh": "录音带……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0033_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0033_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "3b815f0f739137cb1ef5746205844756b322f70f1a4c0dc632ad049c4e30afe9", "ja": "はい！　それで{$P$}も、ぐっすり\nたっぷり眠れるかも！　楽しみにしててくださいね！", "zh": "对！这样一来{$P$}说不定也\n可以睡得饱饱的！请你好好期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
